  <History Date="14-01-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="16-01-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="21-01-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised gobo shake functions in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (original charts only had one range)" />
